  "historyNote": "#2055, eff 6-16-82; ss by #2714, eff 5-16-84; ss by #4851, eff 6-25-90; EXPIRED 6-25-96 New. #6349, eff 10-5-96, EXPIRED: 10-5-04 New. #8206, INTERIM, eff 11-18-04, EXPIRES: 5-17-05; ss by #8335, eff 4-23-05, EXPIRED: 4-23-13 New. #10785, eff 2-20-15; ss by #13102, eff 10-5-20 (formerly Ed 507.07) (see Revision Note at part heading for Ed 508); ss by #14458, eff 12-13-25, EXPIRES: 12-13-35",
